.agent/active/v1_1_followup_agentability.md:349:`rev_scraping` is a *security-first* agent tool that punches above its weight on stealth, VPN integration, and secret discipline. It is held back from being best-in-class for general-purpose agent consumption by missing **output schemas**, **rate-limit honour**, **structured error taxonomy**, and **progress events**. None of these are large lifts; collectively they would lift the agentability score from ~62 to ~85 within a single Phase 10 sprint, while preserving the strong security floor that already exists.
