.agent/active/scoring/v1_3_k_score_round1_codex.out:2649:        # K.3: any future `unsafe { ... }` block must be preceded by a
.agent/active/scoring/v1_3_k_score_round1_codex.out:2699:# Lane K K.5 — nightly cargo-fuzz cron.
