.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k1_review_round2.out:792:docs/roles/coder/specialties/refactor-safety-analyst.md:22:This specialty prepares a safe refactor plan before code is changed. It maps callers, public and implicit contracts, dependencies, side effects, and test coverage so behavior-preserving changes stay separate from semantic changes. It is used for Coder-owned refactor planning and may hand off to implementation only after the blast radius is clear.
