.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k1_review_round2.out:798:docs/roles/reviewer/specialties/staff-code-reviewer.md:22:This specialty reviews submitted code or diffs for problems that should block PR progress, require pre-release fixes, or require explicit risk acceptance. It prioritizes correctness, security, performance, operational behavior, and meaningful test coverage over style preference. It is a Reviewer narrowing and cannot edit code.
