.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_j_lane_review_round1.out:372:| K.1 | `cargo-llvm-cov` CI job; soft gate at 80% line / 70% branch for v1.3, hardened to 85% / 75% in v1.4 | 0.5 | CI artifact; PR comment with delta |
