.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:339:| H.7 | `release-please` automation (tag → matrix build → SBOM → cosign → GH release) | 0.8 | one-tag release: deb+rpm+brew+OCI+cargo all populated in single workflow run |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:374:## Lane K — Quality moat
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:380:| K.1 | `cargo-llvm-cov` CI job; soft gate at 80% line / 70% branch for v1.3, hardened to 85% / 75% in v1.4 | 0.5 | CI artifact; PR comment with delta |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:381:| K.2 | `cargo-deny` + `cargo-audit` + `cargo-msrv verify` three-point CI gate | 0.5 | `deny.toml` extended (license allowlist, banned-crates, advisory deny); failures block merge |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:382:| K.3 | `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]` on every crate root; `obscura-bridge` exempted with `#![deny(unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn)]` + SAFETY doc lint | 0.4 | grep verification CI step; SAFETY doc check on every unsafe block |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:383:| K.4 | proptest expansion: stealth-auth (envelope roundtrip + AAD mismatch) + stealth-agent-contracts (UUID v4 + IdempotencyKey + RateLimiter) + vpn-rotate (rotation invariants) | 0.8 | each crate has ≥1 prop test; 256 iter standard / 1024 iter nightly |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:384:| K.5 | `cargo-fuzz` 3 targets: `sanitize::layer4_unicode::normalize`, `sanitize::layer2_envelope::parse`, MCP JSON-RPC frame parser | 0.7 | targets build; nightly GH cron 1h/day; crash artifacts pinned as seed |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:385:| K.6 | Cross-platform CI matrix: Linux x86_64 + Linux aarch64 (QEMU) + macOS x86_64 + macOS arm64 | 0.6 | `cargo test --release` PASS on all 4 |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:386:| K.7 | criterion benchmarks on 5 hot paths (sanitize walk / canary scan / AAD encrypt-decrypt / MCP dispatch / recipe load) + per-PR diff via `bencher.dev` | 0.6 | regression > 10% triggers PR comment + label |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:387:| K.8 | SBOM (CycloneDX) + sigstore cosign sign-blob + SLSA L3 attestation (deduplicate with H.6 — both share infra) | 0.3 (shared) | `.spdx.json` + `.cdx.json` attached to GH release |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:389:**Lane K total: 4.4 dev-day**
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:399:| K    | K.4 → K.5             | 1.5 |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:407:- H.6 ↔ K.8 share SBOM/cosign infra (do once, reference twice)
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:408:- I.5 ↔ K.6 share `cargo-public-api` (define once)
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:426:8. **Trust the supply chain**: SBOM + cosign-verified release artifact
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k8_review.out:447:| QEMU aarch64 CI 5-10x slower | K.6 | aarch64 runs nightly-only; per-PR is x86_64 + macOS |
