.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k5_review.out:317:8. **Trust the supply chain**: SBOM + cosign-verified release artifact
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k5_review.out:338:| QEMU aarch64 CI 5-10x slower | K.6 | aarch64 runs nightly-only; per-PR is x86_64 + macOS |
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k5_review.out:361:- `.agent/active/prompts/v1_3_k[1-8]_review*.md` (Lane K)
.agent/active/reviews/v1_3_k5_review.out:388:| `release-please` over manual release.yml | Reduces release fatigue, ships SBOM/cosign in one workflow | Plan A 2.16 |
