The local toolchain confirms the sandbox limitation: `cargo +nightly` cannot update under `~/.rustup`, and `cargo fuzz` is not installed. I started the stable `cargo check` for the fuzz manifest because it is still useful syntax/build evidence without requiring the GH fuzz runner.
codex
The default Cargo cache path is outside the writable sandbox, so the stable fuzz-manifest check also hit a filesystem-permission blocker. I’m retrying with `CARGO_HOME` and `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` under `/private/tmp` to see whether we can get durable local compile evidence without touching the user’s home cache.
